                                <svg class="products-tab-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M6 19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h8a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7H6v12zM19 4h-3.5l-1-1h-5l-1 1H5v2h14V4z"/></svg>
                                Eliminar
